<P class="tit">关于西安电子科技大学学生体质测试补测的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2024-04-23&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 13237)</script>)</SPAN></P>
         <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
