<section class="docx">
 <article>
  <p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
  <p style="min-height: 20pt; line-height: 20pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;
    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute;left:0pt;margin-left:-14.25pt;margin-top:6.8pt;height:0pt;width:441pt;z-index:251659264;mso-width-relative:page;mso-height-relative:page;">
     <image stroke="#FF0000" stroke-width="1.5pt" width="100%" height="100%"></image>
    </svg></span></p>
  <p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各学院：</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">根据国家和学校《国家学生体质健康标准（2014年修订）》的测试成绩达不到50分者，按结业或肄业处理（西电教[2015]63号文件）文件精神要求，对学校本科学生体质测试不合格者进行补测。具体说明如下：</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">一、测试对象：</span><span id="_Hlk529784150"></span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">面向</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">我校</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2020、2021、2022、2023年度未测试或体测不合格的</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">展开</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（北校区的学生在南校区进行补测）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">二、</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">测试项目、场地</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 14.05pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（一）测试项目：</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">身高、体重、肺活量、坐位体前屈、立定跳远、50米跑、引体向上（男）、一分钟仰卧起坐（女）、1000米跑（男）、800米跑（女）。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 14.05pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（二）测试场地：</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">北田径场主席台下体测教室：身高、体重、肺活量、坐位体前屈；</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 7pt; margin-left: 21pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(38, 38, 38); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">北田径场：立定跳远、50米、引体向上、仰卧起坐、1000米、800米。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">三、测试时间安排：</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 14.2pt;"><span id="_Hlk534975193"></span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（一）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">测试时间安排：</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2024年4月</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">26（周五）</span><span id="_Hlk534975139"></span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">14:0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0-1</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">6:0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 112, 192); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 14.2pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（二）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">如在统一安排时间段，因天气原因不能如期测试</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">体育部将另行安排时间，并通知到各学院。</span></p>
  <p class="docx_9" style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">四、补测说明</span><span id="_GoBack"></span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（一）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">对于学生体质测试不合格的学生，在进行补测时要向测试工作人员说明补测的年度，</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">如：2</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">20级学生在补测时需明确要补2</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">20年/2</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">21年/2022年/2</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">23年中的哪一年度。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（二</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生补测时，不是每个项目都测试一遍，只补测在原来的基础上有提高的项目和没有测试成绩的项目。成绩没有提升的项目不需要补测。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（三）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生体质测试成绩查询：</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">西电体育微信公众号</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">→输入学号→密码（原始1</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">23456</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">）→修改密码→查询体质测试成绩。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> （四）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生毕业时体测成绩和等级的算法：按毕业当年学年总分的50%与其他学年总分平均得分的50%之和进行评定。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">五、要求：</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 7pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（一）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">请各学院做好宣传、动员、组织工作，提前通知学生进行体育锻炼，恢复体能。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 7pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（二）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">测试前请注意休息，严禁在熬夜、感冒、发烧、空腹等身体不适的情况下参加体质测试。测试中如出现身体不适，请迅速联系医务人员,测试点设立医疗服务，医生、护士负责现场应急事件的急救处理。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 7pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（三）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> 对因身体缺陷、患慢性病、心脏病、先天发育不良等疾病或不适宜参加规定项目测试的学生可申请免测。为保证测试正常进行，杜绝因测试引发的安全事故，</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">请申请免测的学生提前将申请材料交至体育部教学研究科。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">免测申请办理流程：</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生将三甲医院证明或残疾证复印件，粘贴在填写好的《免予执行国家学生体质健康标准申请表》背面</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（申请表在体育部官网下载专区下载）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">→辅导员签字→学生交教学研究科→存入学生档案。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（四）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">测试时学生务必携带校园一卡通。证件丢失请提前办理，无校园一卡通者不予测试。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（五）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">测试时务必身着运动鞋和运动服。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> &nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">（六）</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">凡在测试中弄虚作假，一经发现，取消测试成绩并全校通报，情节恶劣者按考试作弊报予教务处。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 28pt; text-align: left;"><br></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 28pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">请各学院及时通知本院学生，配合做好2024年度</span><span id="_Hlk529782592"></span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">学生</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">体质健康补测安排的宣传管理工作，</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 32, 96); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">特别是2020级毕业生，请抓住这次体质测试补测机会。体育部联系方式：8</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 32, 96); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">1891197</span><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 32, 96); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">。</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">西安电子科技大学体育部</span></p>
  <p style="min-height: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; margin-right: 24pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: var(--docx-minorEastAsia-font); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2024年4月23日</span></p>
 </article>
</section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></DIV>
   
    
    <p align="right" style="display:none;">【<a href="javascript:window.opener=null;window.open('','_self');window.close();">关闭</a>】</p>
</div>
</form>

